{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32389","headline":"盘石寺留别成公 · 温庭筠","name":"盘石寺留别成公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槲叶萧萧带苇风，寺前归客别支公。\n三秋岸雪花初白，一夜林霜叶尽红。\n山叠楚天云压塞，浪遥吴苑水连空。\n悠然旅榜频回首，无复松窗半偈同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}